#
# Emerson EWF2004/EWF2004A (Funai) service/factory remote codes.
# Service_mode_enter is a normal-format Emerson frame (device 41, function 63).
# Factory_* frames repeat device+function in the second 12 bits instead of complementing them.
# Only the TV's service mode reacts to them. Keys marked untested were not captured from a real remote.
#
